  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg931oajAYNIsy9Jcacc8lyIe_QwenpwlMO3s0UDC-C8w_VsIg5Ro4x0xHlafk4MmA13i4cjewvS_xnijxRKIL4HdNTuD187F9Mvw_YbUwlfVLx5o_zGNjSNVIyIwP_sEgokc98PPZXbLATZ1vB4cslXR5TJM0NKy3eFg3_EtswJ5zg6TBaS7TMxI60ua0/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-09-25T142842.494.jpeg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg931oajAYNIsy9Jcacc8lyIe_QwenpwlMO3s0UDC-C8w_VsIg5Ro4x0xHlafk4MmA13i4cjewvS_xnijxRKIL4HdNTuD187F9Mvw_YbUwlfVLx5o_zGNjSNVIyIwP_sEgokc98PPZXbLATZ1vB4cslXR5TJM0NKy3eFg3_EtswJ5zg6TBaS7TMxI60ua0/s320/Designer%20-%202024-09-25T142842.494.jpeg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מבחן רוסי</span></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">😉מבחן רוסי - מוגבל (סובייטי)<br /></span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מבחן זה, הפוך ממבחן אמריקאי.<br /></span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">לכל שאלה - תיתכן יותר מתשובה אחת, אבל כל התשובות מבוססות על מילים <u>ששורשן</u> בפרשה.</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גשם?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מָטָר</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רָבִיב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קֶטֶב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רֶשֶׁף</span></li></ol><li>הִתנפחת?</li><ol><li>שָׁמַנְתָּ</li><li>תֶּשִׁי</li><li>עָבִיתָ</li><li>כָּשִׂיתָ</li></ol><li>כנף?</li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יְשִׁימוֹן</span></li><li>תֶּשִׁי</li><li>חַלָּמִישׁ</li><li>אֶבְרָה</li></ol><li>בקר?</li><ol><li>עַתּוּדִים</li><li>בְּהֵמֹת</li><li>שַׁדְמוֹת</li><li>כָּרִים</li></ol><li>לא ישר?</li><ol><li>מְפֻתָּל</li><li>נָבָל</li><li>עִקֵּשׁ</li><li>אוֹיֵב</li></ol><li>יין?</li><ol><li>חַלָּמִישׁ</li><li>דַּם עֵנָב</li><li>שָׂדַי</li><li>חָמֶר</li></ol><li>אבן?</li><ol><li>חַלָּמִישׁ</li><li>צוּר</li><li>סֶלַע</li><li>שְׁאוֹל</li></ol><li>נחשים?</li><ol><li>תַּנִּינִים</li><li>כָּרִים</li><li>תְּנוּבוֹת</li><li>פְּתָנִים</li></ol><li>ירים אותו?</li><ol><li>יֶּנִקֶּהוּ</li><li>יַנְחֶנּוּ</li><li>יַרְכִּבֵהוּ</li><li>יִשָּׂאֵהוּ</li></ol></ol></span><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">תשבץ מדרג-אות</span></h2></div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #212121; font-size: large; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 ערימה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 חסר טעם<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 תְּבַקֵּשׁ<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 סיבובי (מהפרשה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 לאכול עם לחם<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 ממיני הירקות<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 עיר בישראל (ראשי תיבות)</span></p><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #212121; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: center; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></span></h2><h3 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מבחן רוסי</span></span></span></h3><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לשאלה 1 ייתכנו התשובות: 1+2<br />לשאלה&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">2 ייתכנו התשובות: 1+3+4<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לשאלה 3 ייתכנו התשובות: 4<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לשאלה 4&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ייתכנו התשובות:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">1+2+4<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לשאלה 5&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ייתכנו התשובות: 1+3<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לשאלה 6&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ייתכנו התשובות: 2+4</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לשאלה 7&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ייתכנו התשובות: 1+2+3<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לשאלה 8&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ייתכנו התשובות: 1+4<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לשאלה 9&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ייתכנו התשובות: 3+4</span></span></p><h3 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-style: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-style: inherit;\">תל, תפל</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-style: inherit;\">, תְּפַלֵּל, פְּתַלְתֹּל, לְלַפֵּת, לֶפֶת, פ\"ת</span></p></span></span></span></div>"
}
